--   Fluorescent Penetrant Testing  fluorescent_penetrant_testing   1 machine(s)  wage 4 - Metal  mfr location USA
--   Hydrostatic Leak Testing       hydrostatic_leak_testing        1 machine(s)  wage 4 - Metal  mfr location USA
--   Magnetic Particle Testing      magnetic_particle_testing       3 machine(s)  wage 4 - Metal  mfr location USA
--   Pack & Load                    pack_and_load                   6 machine(s)  wage 1 - Metal  mfr location USA
--   Ultrasonic A-Scan              ultrasonic_a_scan               3 machine(s)  wage 6 - Metal  mfr location Virtual
